	(text "Use the Industrial Grade MRAM for max magnetic protection. ( C in MRxA08xCYSxx )\n\nAll components need to be 1.2mm tall or less to allow 0.8mm min wall thickness for 3d printed cover.\n(low-profile caps, thin-sot ldo)"
